      near-full-match edge cases, single-char-corruption discrimination,
      determinism check, 100-vector shared-logic bulk differential loop
      over subject length 0..99 with rotating suffix classes incl. empty
      and too-long suffixes, 2026-08-18)"
    c_status: retained_as_test_oracle
    perf_status: "No PERF finding — pure-Simple str_ends_with measured
      ~1.8x the C oracle (interpreter dispatch to
      `.as_bytes().ends_with()`) over the 100-vector bulk corpus
      (simple_us=17415, c_us=9654, single run, tree-walk interpreter via
      `bin/simple test`, 2026-08-18), below the plan's 2x threshold."
    perf_measured: >
      100 shared branch-covering (subject, suffix) pairs (subject length
      0..99 via seeded LCG with a repeated "zz" motif every 6th position;
      suffix rotates through empty/too-long/"zz"/single-uppercase-char/
